a</span>: We put on a pint of cottage cheese. Not too much. And then we lay the top layer of noodles. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Then how much cheese do we spread on top?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We spread about 16 ounces of grated mozzarella cheese to top it off. Now we bake it for about 45 minutes."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le03ob05re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le03ob05re2aud01", "images": []}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}]}